a Pradesh, Manipur, Odisha, Rajasth an and \nTripura. State wise details of proposals / houses are at Annexure I.  \n \n(c) Details of number of houses sanctioned under PM AY-U in the \ncountry, State/UT-wise and district-wise including the State of \nTamil Nadu are at Annexure II.  \n \n(d)The total budget allocated for PMAY-U during the  last three \nyears i.e. in F.Y. 2018-19, F.Y. 2019-20 and F.Y. 2 020-21 are \n\u00016,505 \ncrore, \u00016,853.26 crore and \u000121,000 crore respectively. Apart from \nbudgetary allocation, \u000120,000 crore, \u000115,000 crore and \u000110,000 \ncrore respectively were provided as Extra Budgetary  Resource \n(EBR) during these Financial Years.  \n \n (e) State/UT wise and year wise number of houses c onstructed \nunder PMAY-U in the country, including State of And hra Pradesh \nare at Annexure III.  \n***** \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nAnnexure I referred in reply to LSUQNo-539 due for 22-07-2021 \n \nState wise details of 3.61Lakh houses approved under PMAY-U by 54 th  \nCSMC  \n held on 08.06.2021  \n \n \n \n \nSr. No. \n \n \nName of the State \nNo of \nProposals \nSanctioned \nunder BLC \nHouses considered for \nApproval of Central \nAssistance in all \nProposals(BLC&AHP) \n1 AndhraPradesh 75 1,74,156 \n2 Bihar 7 6,739 \n3 Chhattisgarh 138 36,177 \n4 Gujarat 96 31,824 \n5 HimachalPradesh 60 1,928 \n6 Karnataka 168 50,050 \n7 MadhyaPradesh 29 15,734 \n8 Manipur 2 514 \n9 Odisha 92 34,561 \n10 Rajasthan 17 2,265 \n11 Tripura 24 6,783 \nGrand \nTotal \n708 3,60,731 \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nAnnexure II referred in reply to LSUQ No- 539 due for 22-07-2021 \nState/UT wise and district wise details of houses sanctioned \nUnder PMAY-U \n \n \nSl No  \n \nName of State \n \nName of District \nHouses \nSanctioned \n(Nos) \n1 A&N Island(UT) South Andaman 602  \n A&N  Island(UT)Total   602  \n1 AndhraPradesh Anantapuramu 1,66,531  \n2 AndhraPradesh Chittoor 2,03,066  \n3 AndhraP