tate Government has informed that the\nDetailed Project Reports (DPRs) of these projects are still under preparation stage.\nAs per provisions of the ongoing \"Flood Management and Border Areas Programme (FMBAP)\nof Ministry of Jal Shakti, it is not be possible to include any new projects of flood management for funding\nunder this Programme at this stage. The process of formulation and approval of the centrally sponsored\nscheme, Flood Management and Border Areas Programme (FMBAP) of Ministry of J al Shakti for the\nperiod 2021 -2026 is presently underway. lnclusion of new projects for funding will depend upon the\ncontours of new scheme as and when approved by the Government of lndia. Meanwhile, the process of\ntechno-economic acceptance by the Advisor y Committee and investment clearance by the Ministry of Jal\nShakti, which are prerequisites for funding under any scheme of the Ministry can be taken up.\n******\n\nANNEXURE-I\nAnnexure referred to in reply to part (a) to (d) of Lok Sabha Unstarred Question No. 608 to be\nanswered on 22.07.2021 on ‘Kuttanad Package’.\nSl.\nNo. Name of Scheme\nEstimated\nCost (in\nCrores)\nBenefitted\ndistricts\nRivers/\ntributaries\nBenefitte\nd Area\n(in\nHectares)\nBenefitted\npopuation\n(in nos.)\n1. KP-FMP -Development of Thottappally\nleading c hannel, bye pass canals and\nflood control regulators for improving\nefficiency of TSW\n500 Alappuzha Pamba,\nAchenkovil,\nManimala\n50,000 3.50,000\n2. KP-FMP - Mitigation of flood damages\nin padasekharams in Kainakary,\nPulinkunnu and Veliyanad panchayath\nin Kuttanad L.A Constituency\n206 Alappuzha Pamba,\nManimala\n2581.11 63633\n3. KP-FMP - Mitigation of flood damages\nin padasekharams in Nedumudy,\nChambakkulam and Muttar panchayaths\nin Kuttanad L.A Constituency\n196 Alappuzha Pamba,\nManimala\n3715.1 51270\n4. KP-FMP - Mitigation of flood damages\nin padasekharams in Thakkazhy\npanchayath in Kuttanad L.A\nConstituency\n183 Alappuzha Pamba,\nManimala\n1732.43 20951\n5. KP-FMP - 