en at Annexure-II.\n\nAnnexure-I\nList of District Public Health Labs (DPHLs)for Testing of Epidemic prone Diseases\nS. No State/UT (Total No.\nof Districts)\nTotal Number\nof DPHLs\nStrengthened\ntill date (July\n2021)\nTotal\nNumber of\nDPHLs\nSanctioned\nin  2021-\n2022\nDistrict\n1\nAndaman &\nNicobar Island (3) 3 0\nAndaman\n2\nNorth & Middle Andman\n3 Car Nicobar\n4\nAndhra Pradesh\n(13) 13 6 Vizianagaram\n5 Nellore\n6 West Godavari (Eluru)\n7 Prakasam\n8\nEast Godavari\n(Rajamahendravaram)\n9\nKrishna (Machilipatnam)\n10 Anantapur (Hindupur)\n11\nChittoor(Madanpali)\n12 Kadapa (Prodduturu)\n13 Kurnool (Nandhayal)\n14 Guntur(Tenali)\n15 Vishakapatnam (Paderu)\n16 Srikakulam( Tekkali)\n17\nArunachal Pradesh\n(20) 4 0 Papumpare\n18 East Siang\n19\nLohit Tezu-Sunpura\n20 Bomdila- West Kaming\n21 Assam (33) 30 3 Golaghat\n\n22 Lakhimpur\n23 Dhubri\n24 Goalpara\n25 Nagaon\n26 Nalbari\n27 Tinsukia\n28 Sivasagar\n29 Kokrajhar\n30 Dima Hasao\n31\nDarrang (Mangaldoi)\n32 Dhemaji\n33 Kamrup Metro\n34\nKarbi- Anglong (Diphu)\n35 Bongaigaon\n36 Udalgiri\n37 Baksa\n38 Chirang\n39 Hailakandi\n40 Karimganj\n41 Morigaon\n42 Barpeta\n43 Sonitpur\n44 Jorhat\n45 Cachar\n46 Dibrugarh\n47 Kamrup R\n48 Charaideo\n49 Hojai\n50 Majuli\n51 Bihar (38) 6 0 Patna (PMCH)\n52 Siwan\n53 East Champaran\n54 Jamui\n55 Rohtas\n56 Purnia\n\n57 Chandigarh (1) 1 Chandigarh\n58 Chattisgarh (27) 9 0 Durg\n59 Surguja\n60 Bilaspur\n61 Koriya\n62 Kanker\n63 Dhamtari\n64 Kawardha\n65 Bemetara\n66 Bijapur\n67\nDadra & Nagar\nHaveli (1) 1\n0 Dadra & Nagar Haveli\n(Silvassa)\n68 Daman & Diu (2) 2\n0 Daman\n69 Diu\n70 Delhi (11) 1 0 South Delhi\n71 Gujarat (33) 24 0 Mahesana\n72\nGMERS, Himmatnagar\n73 Nadiad, Khera\n74\nGMERS- Junagadh\n75 Navsari\n76 Surendranagar\n77\nGodhra, Panchamahal\n78 Vyara, Tapi\n79 Amreli\n80 Porbandar\n81 Petlad, Anand\n82\nDev Bhumi Dwarka\n(Jamkhambhaliya)\n83 Palanpur\n84 Narmada\n85 GMERS- Sola\n86 GMERS- Kutch\n87 Dahod\n\n88 Bharuch\n89 Dang\n90 Morbi\n91 Mahisagar\n92 Ch